## Module Feature Breakdown

---

### Module 1: Connect 🌐

**Purpose:** First touchpoint for new members. Meeting people in the regenerative space.
++ Intentional human connection — matching, directory, events, requests/offers.

**Features:**

| Feature | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| **User Profiles** | Bio, avatar, location, interests, skills, looking_for |
| **Discovery Feed** | Algorithmic feed of people you might connect with |
| **Interest Tags** | Search/filter by: permaculture, governance, art, tech, etc. |
| **Skill Tags and mathcing** | Search/filter by: carpentry, facilitation, cooking, etc. |
| **Geographic Search** | "Near me" filter for local connections |
| **Direct Messaging** | Private 1:1 conversations |
| **Activity Status** | Online/offline indicators |
| **Social Proof** | Community affiliations, mutual connections |
| **Resident Directory** | Searchable profile directory for subgroups (neighborhoods, other group types - location, hobbies etc) |
| **Filter Directory** | By role, skills, interests |
| **Request System** | Post what you need (help, items, time) |
| **Offer System** | Post what you can give |
| **Icebreakers** | AI-generated conversation starters |
| **Weekly Digests** | Notification of new potential connections |
| **Community Calendar** | Events with time, location, virtual link |
| **Event RSVP** | Track attendance, send reminders |
| **Event Categories** | Social, governance, learning, work |

**Data:** `users`, `connections`, `events`, `event_rsvps`, `requests_offers`

