## Development Phases

### Phase 1: Foundation (Weeks 1-4)
- Database setup
- Authentication
- User profiles (Module 1)
- Community profiles (Module 2)
- Blueprint integration (Module 3)

### Phase 2: Community Building (Weeks 5-8)
- Join module (Module 5)
- Network/Feed combined (Module 2)
- Hub module (Module 4)
- Basic Ops (Module 7)

### Phase 3: Governance & Payments (Weeks 9-12)
- Pacts module (Module 6)
- Council module (Module 9)
- Stripe integration

### Phase 4: Intelligence (Weeks 13-16)
- Community Connection (Module 8)
- Earn module (Module 10)
- Quinn module (Module 11)
- Hive module (Module 12)

